msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.NOTIFICATION.TITLE"
msgid "Handle with care!"
msgstr "取扱注意！"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.NOTIFICATION.TOOLTIP"
msgid "These items were picked up outside the temperature range set in Hot Potato:"
msgstr "Hot Potato で設定した温度の範囲外のアイテムが拾われました:"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.NOTIFICATION.MESSAGE"
msgid "{0} picked up {1} ({2})"
msgstr "{0} が {1} を拾いました（{2}）"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.TOOL.NAME"
msgid "Hot Potato Settings"
msgstr "Hot Potato 設定"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.TOOL.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Turn the pickup temperature warnings on or off. The threshold and mode are in the mod options."
msgstr "拾われたアイテムの温度警告のON/OFFを切り替えます。しきい値と判定方法はMod設定で変更します"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.MODE.NAME"
msgid "Warn when temperature is"
msgstr "警告する温度"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.MODE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Warn when a picked-up item is above or below the threshold, like a Thermo Sensor."
msgstr "拾われたアイテムの温度がしきい値を超えたとき、または下回ったときに警告します（温度センサーと同じ考え方です）"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.MODE.ABOVE"
msgid "Above threshold"
msgstr "しきい値を超過"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.MODE.ABOVE_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Warn about items hotter than the threshold."
msgstr "しきい値より熱いアイテムを警告します"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.MODE.BELOW"
msgid "Below threshold"
msgstr "しきい値を下回る"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.MODE.BELOW_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Warn about items colder than the threshold."
msgstr "しきい値より冷たいアイテムを警告します"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.THRESHOLD.NAME"
msgid "Threshold (°C)"
msgstr "しきい値（℃）"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.THRESHOLD.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Temperature that triggers the warning. Cooking stations output food at 95 °C and the Kiln at 80 °C, so an \"above\" threshold below those warns about every meal or brick."
msgstr "警告の基準になる温度です。調理設備の料理は 95℃、窯の生産物は 80℃ で出てくるため、「超過」でそれより低い値にすると、料理やレンガを運ぶたびに警告が出ます"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.PAUSE_GAME.NAME"
msgid "Pause the game"
msgstr "ゲームを一時停止"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.PAUSE_GAME.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Pause the game when such an item is picked up."
msgstr "範囲外の温度のアイテムが拾われたら、ゲームを一時停止します"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.SHOW_NOTIFICATION.NAME"
msgid "Show a notification"
msgstr "通知を表示"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.SHOW_NOTIFICATION.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Show a notification naming the carrier, the item and its temperature. Click it to focus the carrier."
msgstr "拾った者、アイテム、温度を通知で表示します。クリックすると、拾った者にカメラが移動します"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.INCLUDE_AUTO_SWEEPERS.NAME"
msgid "Include Auto-Sweepers"
msgstr "自動スイーパーも対象にする"

msgctxt "HotPotato.STRINGS.OPTIONS.INCLUDE_AUTO_SWEEPERS.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Also warn when an Auto-Sweeper picks up such an item."
msgstr "自動スイーパーが範囲外の温度のアイテムを拾った場合も警告します"
